      "Anchor": "crm-data-validation---design-considerations",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The Design Considerations Guide includes recommendations and guidance when you are integrating with Sales Navigator Sync Services.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Creating Successful Export Jobs",
      "Anchor": "creating-successful-export-jobs",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Creating Successful Export Jobs"
      ],
      "Text": "If there is export job created previously, use the value of nextExportStartAt in previous request as the value of exportStartAt in current request.\nSince data validation pipeline runs once everyday, do not build your integration to repeatedly creates jobs looking for data within the past 24 hours.\nWhen polling periodically for an export job\u0027s status, it is recommended to set an appropriate polling interval to avoid unnecessary calls, and to stop polling once the export job has completed.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Error Handling",
      "Anchor": "error-handling",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Error Handling"
      ],
