        "Throttling and Limits"
      ],
      "Text": "To prevent abuse and to ensure service stability, everyday any app is granted a quota of 50 requests to create export jobs, and 5000 requests to query export jobs every day. Read Error Handling - 429 Rate Limit to learn more about throttling and limits.",
